# Master folders dropped into the asset slots are NOT publishable. The site serves
# flat web copies made by tools/make_assets.py; anything in a subfolder here is a
# master, a reference plate, or someone else's file. Ignoring the SUBFOLDERS keeps
# the flat web copies tracked. Added 2026-09-11 after 145 MB of AI masters landed
# in assets/ai/ while the documented publish command is still `git add -A`.
assets/ai/*/
assets/films/*/
assets/edits/*/
assets/photos/*/

# THE GALLERY, the third door, built 2026-09-17. HELD BACK ON PURPOSE.
